WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.250
What happens when 800 of the world’s most elite footballers

00:00:07.250 --> 00:00:09.666
and their managers live together under one roof?

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:11.458
Players stop being polite

00:00:11.458 --> 00:00:13.583
and start getting Real.

00:00:13.583 --> 00:00:14.208
This is

00:00:14.208 --> 00:00:15.541
The Champions

00:00:15.541 --> 00:00:17.916
I kick shins and knees like they’re balls.

00:00:17.958 --> 00:00:20.083
I also kick balls like they’re balls.

00:00:20.083 --> 00:00:21.416
I am so pumped to join Chelsea,

00:00:21.416 --> 00:00:22.666
because I was in danger

00:00:22.666 --> 00:00:24.041
of actually winning things at Dortmund,

00:00:24.041 --> 00:00:25.375
and that would go against everything

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:27.375
the U.S. men's national team believes in.

00:00:27.375 --> 00:00:29.250
Every time we get a bad result,

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:31.041
I take a hard look in the mirror...

00:00:31.041 --> 00:00:33.083
and I blame the officials, the wind,

00:00:33.083 --> 00:00:35.458
the cut of the grass, the smells of the stadium, the

00:00:35.458 --> 00:00:36.458
I’m back, and winning

00:00:36.458 --> 00:00:37.083
I’m back, and winning

00:00:37.083 --> 00:00:39.208
is in my jeans.

00:00:55.666 --> 00:00:57.791
Nice to finally be out of that shadow.

00:01:00.666 --> 00:01:02.000
Hey Cristiano

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:03.375
not to be that guy, but

00:01:03.375 --> 00:01:05.333
would you sign my Ronaldo jersey?

00:01:05.333 --> 00:01:06.041
Of course.

00:01:06.041 --> 00:01:07.458
It is very tiny.

00:01:07.458 --> 00:01:09.458
It's from when I was a baby.

00:01:09.458 --> 00:01:11.125
It's from when you were a baby?

00:01:11.125 --> 00:01:13.208
Oh my God, you're like a man now.

00:01:13.208 --> 00:01:15.041
And you...are a legend.

00:01:15.041 --> 00:01:16.041
Merci, mon ami.

00:01:16.041 --> 00:01:16.916
A legend?

00:01:16.916 --> 00:01:21.541
Like...Raul? Or Pele? Or Figo?

00:01:21.541 --> 00:01:22.916
Legends are old.

00:01:22.916 --> 00:01:25.916
No. Am I...old?

00:01:28.458 --> 00:01:29.125
Thank you for seeing me

00:01:29.125 --> 00:01:30.125
doctor Iceland guy.

00:01:30.125 --> 00:01:31.833
I'm having an emergency.

00:01:31.833 --> 00:01:33.166
Oh no, did you chip a tooth?

00:01:33.166 --> 00:01:33.875
What? No!

00:01:33.875 --> 00:01:34.791
My teeth are perfect.

00:01:34.791 --> 00:01:36.375
I here because...

00:01:36.375 --> 00:01:38.166
I think I'm aging.

00:01:38.166 --> 00:01:39.500
I don't think he understands

00:01:39.500 --> 00:01:41.250
what a dentist does.

00:01:41.250 --> 00:01:44.666
Cristiano, you have the body of a 23-year-old.

00:01:44.666 --> 00:01:47.416
23? Oh no.

00:01:47.416 --> 00:01:49.041
Just a year ago all the doctors say

00:01:49.041 --> 00:01:50.666
I have body of 22-year-old.

00:01:50.666 --> 00:01:51.791
Now he tells me 23?!

00:01:51.791 --> 00:01:53.708
This is more serious than I thought.

00:01:55.333 --> 00:01:56.458
I thought it best to seek out advice

00:01:56.458 --> 00:01:57.916
from another Juventus legend.

00:01:57.916 --> 00:02:00.125
One who has suffered for many years

00:02:00.125 --> 00:02:01.500
with...the aging.

00:02:01.500 --> 00:02:03.583
Aging is nothing to fear.

00:02:03.583 --> 00:02:06.500
I have been 50 years old since I was 25.

00:02:06.500 --> 00:02:08.375
It's just scary to think that one day

00:02:08.375 --> 00:02:10.958
I might not be the best player in the world.

00:02:10.958 --> 00:02:12.416
Maybe it's time for you

00:02:12.416 --> 00:02:13.791
to take a long look in the mirror.

00:02:13.791 --> 00:02:15.083
Oh nice, do you have a mirror?

00:02:15.083 --> 00:02:16.541
No, what I mean is,

00:02:16.541 --> 00:02:18.833
do you expect to play this game forever?

00:02:18.833 --> 00:02:20.000
Umm...

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:21.000
yeah?

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:23.041
Nobody can play this game forever.

00:02:23.041 --> 00:02:24.750
You are mortal. You can die.

00:02:24.750 --> 00:02:26.666
You are going to get old.

00:02:26.666 --> 00:02:27.458
You are going to die.

00:02:27.458 --> 00:02:30.458
So at this point, I'm like, whoa.

00:02:30.458 --> 00:02:32.416
For someone known for his passes,

00:02:32.416 --> 00:02:34.333
Andrea can be quite a straight shooter.

00:02:35.083 --> 00:02:36.000
So, so what...

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:38.291
am I going to have to...like...retire someday?

00:02:38.291 --> 00:02:40.000
Not yet. You still have

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:41.375
a few years with the Old Lady.

00:02:41.375 --> 00:02:42.625
What do you mean Old Lady?

00:02:42.625 --> 00:02:44.291
Oh...Georgina is 25.

00:02:44.291 --> 00:02:45.500
I mean Juventus.

00:02:45.500 --> 00:02:46.833
OK, but then what?

00:02:46.833 --> 00:02:49.916
Then...you do what all the former elite players do.

00:02:50.583 --> 00:02:52.208
Are you an aging soccer

00:02:52.208 --> 00:02:53.583
er...sorry, football star in Europe?

00:02:53.583 --> 00:02:55.250
Come join MLS!

00:02:55.250 --> 00:02:56.708
Where you can score three goals a game!

00:02:56.708 --> 00:02:58.333
Make hundreds of millions of dollars!

00:02:58.333 --> 00:02:59.791
And you won't get bothered on the streets

00:02:59.791 --> 00:03:01.333
because no one will recognize you!

00:03:01.333 --> 00:03:03.000
Note: The U.S. dollar may be worth less

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:03.750
than euros and pounds.

00:03:03.750 --> 00:03:04.791
In MLS you may be forced

00:03:04.791 --> 00:03:05.958
to play defense and take commercial flights.

00:03:05.958 --> 00:03:06.916
Also everyone has guns.

00:03:06.916 --> 00:03:08.416
Come on over! It's actually

00:03:08.416 --> 00:03:09.750
more challenging than you think!

00:03:09.750 --> 00:03:10.208
Believe me.

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:13.708
Oh God, I need to go.

00:03:18.041 --> 00:03:21.041
Hello, worse Ronaldo. I'm so scared.

00:03:21.041 --> 00:03:23.416
Please tell me retirement will be OK.

00:03:23.416 --> 00:03:24.875
Oh, no, it's great

00:03:24.875 --> 00:03:26.625
you get to eat whatever you want!

00:03:32.666 --> 00:03:35.916
What happens when 800 of the world’s most elite footballers

00:03:35.916 --> 00:03:38.291
and their managers live together under one roof?

00:03:38.291 --> 00:03:38.416
Players stop being polite

00:03:38.416 --> 00:03:40.083
Players stop being polite

00:03:40.083 --> 00:03:42.208
and start getting Real.

00:03:42.208 --> 00:03:42.833
This is

00:03:42.833 --> 00:03:44.291
The Champions

00:03:44.291 --> 00:03:46.958
If you need a cross into the box,

00:03:46.958 --> 00:03:49.416
pray you have an Angel on your wing.

00:03:49.416 --> 00:03:51.541
Money can't buy you silverware...

00:03:51.541 --> 00:03:53.666
is what the chairman keeps telling me.

00:03:53.666 --> 00:03:55.916
Don't hate me because I'm beautiful.

00:03:55.916 --> 00:03:58.166
Hate me because I had a great World Cup

00:03:58.166 --> 00:03:59.041
five years ago

00:03:59.041 --> 00:04:00.583
and not much else.

00:04:00.583 --> 00:04:02.041
I'm not the new Ronaldo.

00:04:02.041 --> 00:04:04.083
I'm the first Vinicius.

00:04:04.083 --> 00:04:06.416
Oh, except for Vinicius Sr.

00:04:11.041 --> 00:04:14.708
OLE, OLE, OLE, OLE, OLE

00:04:14.708 --> 00:04:20.333
OLE, OLE, OLE, OLE, OLE, OLE

00:04:20.333 --> 00:04:22.166
Hey you guys, sorry Gareth bailed

00:04:22.166 --> 00:04:23.916
but thanks for taking the rest of us out!

00:04:23.916 --> 00:04:25.916
Now you are just like your season...

00:04:25.916 --> 00:04:27.166
totally wasted!

00:04:29.916 --> 00:04:30.958
Per La Liga tradition,

00:04:30.958 --> 00:04:33.583
every night we all get dinner at 11 p.m.

00:04:33.583 --> 00:04:34.666
and go to the club

00:04:34.666 --> 00:04:35.833
till about 3 a.m.,

00:04:35.833 --> 00:04:37.291
which makes us perfectly ready

00:04:37.291 --> 00:04:38.291
for breakfast at noon

00:04:38.291 --> 00:04:39.541
and a match at 1.

00:04:40.166 --> 00:04:41.791
Antoine, do you want red or white?

00:04:41.791 --> 00:04:44.541
Hmmmm. That is a tough choice.

00:04:51.333 --> 00:04:54.083
I used to wear the 10 shirt too, you know.

00:04:54.083 --> 00:04:55.041
Let the Little Magician

00:04:55.041 --> 00:04:56.291
show you how it's done.

00:04:58.291 --> 00:05:00.541
Ta-da. I make it disappear! See?!

00:05:00.541 --> 00:05:01.333
Uh, guys...

00:05:01.333 --> 00:05:03.583
excuse me, um, could you-

00:05:05.041 --> 00:05:08.166
Uh, yeah, would you mind keeping it down please?

00:05:08.166 --> 00:05:10.291
I mean, who sleeps that much?

00:05:10.291 --> 00:05:12.083
What planet is he from?

00:05:12.083 --> 00:05:13.541
Come on, Gareth,

00:05:13.541 --> 00:05:15.541
For once, have fun with us.

00:05:15.541 --> 00:05:16.916
Slow down.

00:05:16.916 --> 00:05:18.541
You know I have a problem

00:05:18.541 --> 00:05:20.416
with conversational Spanish!

00:05:20.416 --> 00:05:23.083
We are speaking English to you.

00:05:23.083 --> 00:05:25.333
We just have accents.

00:05:25.333 --> 00:05:26.083
I don't know why

00:05:26.083 --> 00:05:27.333
I haven't been able to fit in...

00:05:27.333 --> 00:05:29.166
I've even learned all the Spanish I need.

00:05:29.166 --> 00:05:30.541
I mean, go ahead. Test me.

00:05:30.541 --> 00:05:32.416
Okay, como estas?

00:05:32.416 --> 00:05:34.208
Estoy herido.

00:05:34.208 --> 00:05:35.208
Que paso?

00:05:35.208 --> 00:05:38.583
...Estoy herido.

00:05:38.583 --> 00:05:40.666
Okay. Uh, you need a scrunchie?

00:05:40.666 --> 00:05:41.708
Two words.

00:05:41.708 --> 00:05:42.666
Do you want us to be louder?

00:05:42.666 --> 00:05:43.333
Sounds like...

00:05:43.333 --> 00:05:43.791
You want a transfer?

00:05:44.833 --> 00:05:46.416
Whoa!

00:05:46.416 --> 00:05:47.958
Not cool, man.

00:05:47.958 --> 00:05:49.041
Oh, oh no.

00:05:49.041 --> 00:05:49.791
I'm sorry.

00:05:49.791 --> 00:05:51.541
It's just I need to be at my best

00:05:51.541 --> 00:05:52.541
for tomorrow's big match.

00:05:52.541 --> 00:05:53.458
Big match?

00:05:53.458 --> 00:05:55.583
Uh, we are out of the Champions League

00:05:55.583 --> 00:05:56.666
and the Copa del Rey.

00:05:56.666 --> 00:05:58.916
And right now we only play La Liga matches

00:05:58.916 --> 00:06:00.791
to get out of the house once in a while.

00:06:00.791 --> 00:06:01.291
Oh, no no no.

00:06:01.291 --> 00:06:02.666
My big golf match...

00:06:02.666 --> 00:06:04.208
I'm trying to beat my personal best.

00:06:04.208 --> 00:06:06.583
Uh, unless you want to join...?

00:06:06.583 --> 00:06:09.166
Anyone?

00:06:09.166 --> 00:06:12.041
Alright, well, see you later.

00:06:12.041 --> 00:06:12.666
What's his deal?!

00:06:12.666 --> 00:06:13.416
Oh my God.

00:06:13.416 --> 00:06:14.916
The man sucks.

00:06:14.916 --> 00:06:17.291
We have a lot of nicknames for Gareth,

00:06:17.291 --> 00:06:19.666
like "the Martian" because we don't like him,

00:06:19.666 --> 00:06:22.166
"the Golfer" because we don't like him,

00:06:22.166 --> 00:06:26.291
or like "Less Good Ronaldo" because we don't like him.

00:06:26.916 --> 00:06:27.666
I don't know.

00:06:27.666 --> 00:06:28.666
Something's off with him, man.

00:06:28.666 --> 00:06:31.458
Nobody in their right mind wouldn't want to hang out with us.

00:06:31.458 --> 00:06:33.166
Maybe he wants a transfer?

00:06:33.166 --> 00:06:34.041
Maybe he's faking an injury?

00:06:34.041 --> 00:06:35.916
I know! Let's go through his stuff

00:06:35.916 --> 00:06:37.041
to find out what he's hiding.

00:06:37.041 --> 00:06:38.541
We could maybe instead go to sleep

00:06:38.541 --> 00:06:40.916
and practice more so we stop losing...

00:06:45.791 --> 00:06:48.791
Guys, I found something.

00:06:48.833 --> 00:06:51.166
Why is his pencil so small?

00:06:51.166 --> 00:06:52.916
I'm scared.

00:06:55.666 --> 00:06:57.291
He really is a martian!

00:06:57.291 --> 00:06:59.166
What's going on? Is it tee time already?!

00:06:59.166 --> 00:07:00.458
Get away from us, alien!

00:07:00.458 --> 00:07:02.666
You're different, and we hate you.

00:07:02.666 --> 00:07:04.416
But that's just my Welsh books,

00:07:04.416 --> 00:07:07.416
my golf pencils and my exfoliating mask.

00:07:07.416 --> 00:07:09.208
Please...por favor.

00:07:09.208 --> 00:07:11.458
Oh NOW you speak Spanish.

00:07:11.458 --> 00:07:13.541
I tried to fit in.

00:07:13.541 --> 00:07:15.041
But after six years,

00:07:15.041 --> 00:07:18.041
it's clear I am the only true Galactico here.

00:07:18.041 --> 00:07:19.666
I don't belong at Real Madrid.

00:07:19.666 --> 00:07:21.583
It's time for me to go home.

00:07:32.166 --> 00:07:34.541
I will stick with the red. Thank you!

00:07:34.541 --> 00:07:36.208
Uh, guys?

00:07:38.250 --> 00:07:41.500
What happens when 800 of the world’s most elite footballers

00:07:41.500 --> 00:07:43.875
and their managers live together under one roof?

00:07:43.875 --> 00:07:44.000
Players stop being polite

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:45.666
Players stop being polite

00:07:45.666 --> 00:07:47.791
and start getting Real.

00:07:47.791 --> 00:07:48.416
This is

00:07:48.416 --> 00:07:49.875
The Champions

00:07:49.875 --> 00:07:51.416
Despite recent results,

00:07:51.416 --> 00:07:54.416
we already got the historic quadruple this season.

00:07:54.416 --> 00:07:55.625
We were investigated by

00:07:55.625 --> 00:07:58.625
UEFA, FIFA, the FA and the Premier League!

00:07:58.625 --> 00:08:01.375
I followed in the footsteps of the greats...

00:08:01.375 --> 00:08:02.625
by leaving Southampton!

00:08:02.625 --> 00:08:04.250
You think Icardi's a dog?

00:08:04.250 --> 00:08:05.791
I shagged me brother's missus.

00:08:05.791 --> 00:08:07.250
-Alright, and that's all we need.

00:08:07.250 --> 00:08:08.750
Thank you for coming in, Mr. Giggs.

00:08:14.875 --> 00:08:16.000
Send message:

00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:19.416
Hello, lads! Meet me in the backyard for a smashing good time.

00:08:22.500 --> 00:08:24.500
Why did Harry Kane text us to...

00:08:24.500 --> 00:08:28.166
cheese him in the backyard for a crashing wood crime?

00:08:29.541 --> 00:08:31.500
Nothing to be scared of, Phil, it's just a tent.

00:08:31.500 --> 00:08:33.875
Oh, I'm not scared. This is my happy face.

00:08:33.875 --> 00:08:36.625
Gentlemen, welcome to Tentingham!

00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:41.750
Oo wunderbar.

00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:43.666
This must have taken you all weekend.

00:08:43.666 --> 00:08:45.791
Yeah...all weekend...

00:08:47.625 --> 00:08:48.416
Come in, come in.

00:08:48.416 --> 00:08:50.625
I thought we'd have a casual day baking.

00:08:50.625 --> 00:08:51.291
It's so new.

00:08:51.291 --> 00:08:52.125
Oh my dog.

00:08:52.125 --> 00:08:52.875
It looks like a toilet seat.

00:08:52.875 --> 00:08:55.541
Hello. Remember me? I'm Arsene.

00:08:55.541 --> 00:08:57.250
And I am the Special One.

00:08:57.250 --> 00:09:02.041
Welcome to the Great British Baking Derby!

00:09:03.625 --> 00:09:06.000
While we're all optimistic, when it comes to a big game,

00:09:06.000 --> 00:09:08.750
Spurs have a tendency to be rather...

00:09:08.750 --> 00:09:09.375
-Spursy?

00:09:09.375 --> 00:09:09.875
That's the word!

00:09:09.875 --> 00:09:11.875
So I asked myself, "If I were British

00:09:11.875 --> 00:09:14.000
and wanted to a win a trophy, what would I do?"

00:09:14.000 --> 00:09:15.916
So I organized a baking competition!

00:09:15.916 --> 00:09:17.625
Now, every competition needs judges,

00:09:17.625 --> 00:09:19.250
so I found the most judgmental

00:09:19.250 --> 00:09:21.166
and also out-of-work people that I know.

00:09:21.166 --> 00:09:22.625
And to ensure that we win,

00:09:22.625 --> 00:09:25.166
I've had the boys practicing baking for weeks now.

00:09:25.166 --> 00:09:27.000
Hopefully this works. And we should win,

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:28.250
because after all,

00:09:28.250 --> 00:09:30.041
we are the only team ready for this.

00:09:30.041 --> 00:09:31.875
F--k yeah, we are ready for this!

00:09:34.125 --> 00:09:36.416
Whoa. You guys have more resources than I do?

00:09:36.416 --> 00:09:37.875
Oh no.

00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:41.166
Liverpool's pies have somehow been impressive all season,

00:09:41.166 --> 00:09:43.375
but something tells me they will slip up in the final.

00:09:43.375 --> 00:09:46.041
Just a fun day out, he said. No stress, he said.

00:09:46.041 --> 00:09:49.250
All of a sudden I'm under a lot of pressure to score...

00:09:49.250 --> 00:09:51.500
ALL THESE PIES!

00:09:53.666 --> 00:09:55.291
Come on, we need to go higher.

00:09:55.291 --> 00:09:58.500
Uh, I fear we may have reached our ceiling.

00:09:58.500 --> 00:10:00.416
Tottenham are making a Tottenham cake

00:10:00.416 --> 00:10:04.125
which is pink and fun, but also crumbly and fragile.

00:10:04.125 --> 00:10:06.125
I'll put the proof in the pudding.

00:10:06.125 --> 00:10:09.416
Ow! My ankle. Now I've got soggy bottoms.

00:10:09.416 --> 00:10:10.375
Oh no.

00:10:10.375 --> 00:10:13.750
Man City will be making a perfect Manchester tart.

00:10:13.750 --> 00:10:15.416
For the literal cherry on top,

00:10:15.416 --> 00:10:17.375
I'm having the finest Maraschino cherries

00:10:17.375 --> 00:10:19.166
flown here on a private jet.

00:10:19.166 --> 00:10:21.625
We are just so happy to have you on our team.

00:10:21.625 --> 00:10:23.791
For their signature bake, Manchester United are making...

00:10:23.791 --> 00:10:25.125
a huge mistake.

00:10:25.125 --> 00:10:27.750
Seriously, they think this garden gnome of a manager is better than me?

00:10:27.750 --> 00:10:29.875
Ah! You got me! Haha!

00:10:29.875 --> 00:10:31.500
Oh, this is fun, isn't it.

00:10:34.000 --> 00:10:36.541
To be honest, I really thought when we hosted this competition

00:10:36.541 --> 00:10:39.500
that the other clubs, they had, like, little to no baking experience,

00:10:39.500 --> 00:10:43.375
but as it turns out they are taking this very seriously, so...

00:10:43.375 --> 00:10:45.416
Guys, you need to focus on the finish.

00:10:45.416 --> 00:10:50.166
Aguero, get the decorative Lancashire roses. 9320 of them!

00:10:50.166 --> 00:10:52.125
Come on, put more pressure on it, Mo.

00:10:54.875 --> 00:10:57.125
These all appear to be top, top quality.

00:10:57.125 --> 00:10:58.791
Voyeur. I won't taste them,

00:10:58.791 --> 00:11:00.000
because I know they are not as good

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:01.666
as the Chelsea buns I made—three times.

00:11:01.666 --> 00:11:04.375
In fourth and last place. You. You. You.

00:11:04.375 --> 00:11:06.125
And especially you, Paul.

00:11:06.125 --> 00:11:07.666
You should all be disappointed.

00:11:07.666 --> 00:11:09.666
Fourth place is nice. Take it from me.

00:11:09.666 --> 00:11:11.416
It is the same as a trophy.

00:11:11.416 --> 00:11:14.000
Okay, but come on, Harry's ankle has been through so much...

00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:16.541
He deserves something for his baking contributions.

00:11:16.541 --> 00:11:17.875
Okay. Fine, whatever.

00:11:17.875 --> 00:11:19.916
Harry Kane, you are hereby a Member of the

00:11:19.916 --> 00:11:22.125
Most Excellent Order of the Baking Empire.

00:11:23.791 --> 00:11:26.125
Hey! Harry's been awarded MBE!

00:11:33.375 --> 00:11:35.250
Alright, Harry. Yeah!

00:11:37.750 --> 00:11:40.791
So, how do we beat Liverpool on the pitch?

00:11:46.583 --> 00:11:49.750
What happens when 800 of the world’s most elite footballers

00:11:49.833 --> 00:11:52.708
and their managers live together under one roof?

00:11:52.708 --> 00:11:54.000
Players stop being polite

00:11:54.000 --> 00:11:56.125
and start getting Real.

00:11:56.125 --> 00:11:56.958
This is

00:11:56.958 --> 00:11:58.208
The Champions

00:11:58.208 --> 00:12:01.333
I'm one of the best players in the world...

00:12:01.333 --> 00:12:02.750
according to my paycheck.

00:12:02.750 --> 00:12:05.125
People say I would be good in the Premier League,

00:12:05.125 --> 00:12:07.458
but first I need to be good in Serie A.

00:12:07.458 --> 00:12:10.500
Thanks, Kepa, but, ugh, we actually need a Champions League goalkeeper.

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:12.583
So, ugh, if you could just, ugh, go ahead and get off the set.

00:12:12.583 --> 00:12:15.333
It was just a cramp. I'm staying. You can't make me go!

00:12:17.083 --> 00:12:20.958
Zizou's back! Isco be alright.

00:12:28.208 --> 00:12:29.625
I can't sleep.

00:12:29.625 --> 00:12:33.500
I haven't slept since that day. We were in total control.

00:12:33.500 --> 00:12:37.375
Then he took it away. My question is...

00:12:37.375 --> 00:12:40.208
Who decided on the sizes of the paintings?

00:12:44.625 --> 00:12:46.375
I am an L.

00:12:46.375 --> 00:12:49.083
No, Antoine. You are not an L.

00:12:49.083 --> 00:12:53.083
You only need cojones in your heart.

00:12:53.083 --> 00:12:53.708
Huh?

00:12:53.708 --> 00:12:57.458
Come on, let's talk somewhere else that doesn't smell like a Porto-Potty.

00:13:00.125 --> 00:13:01.500
Look, you're great, Antoine.

00:13:01.500 --> 00:13:04.708
Your hair deserves to be up there with the legends.

00:13:04.708 --> 00:13:05.833
But do you?

00:13:05.833 --> 00:13:08.583
Why not?! I'm just as good as Ronaldo and Messi!

00:13:08.583 --> 00:13:09.333
...At what?

00:13:09.333 --> 00:13:10.750
I won the World Cup!

00:13:10.750 --> 00:13:14.625
Mbappe won the World Cup. Now shut up and follow me.

00:13:17.500 --> 00:13:19.458
Ah, the book no one reads.

00:13:20.208 --> 00:13:23.458
Whoa! Encroyable...

00:13:23.458 --> 00:13:26.958
OK, so apparently there's some kind of secret fight club

00:13:26.958 --> 00:13:28.208
going on in the basement.

00:13:29.125 --> 00:13:33.500
Gentlemen, welcome to Fight-letico.

00:13:33.500 --> 00:13:36.583
Yeah, so we never told Antoine about the secret fight club

00:13:36.583 --> 00:13:40.333
because he's always got thousands of cameras following him.

00:13:40.333 --> 00:13:41.250
Oh wait, f--k.

00:13:41.250 --> 00:13:43.458
The first rule of Fight-letico is:

00:13:43.458 --> 00:13:46.125
You do not talk about Fight-letico...

00:13:46.125 --> 00:13:48.833
unless a streaming service offers you a lot of money.

00:13:48.833 --> 00:13:49.208
Uh huh.

00:13:49.208 --> 00:13:49.833
Got it.

00:13:49.833 --> 00:13:50.458
Like how much money?

00:13:50.458 --> 00:13:53.083
The second rule of Fight-letico is:

00:13:53.083 --> 00:13:54.708
IF you do talk about Fight-letico

00:13:54.708 --> 00:13:56.750
because a streaming service offered you a lot of money,

00:13:56.750 --> 00:14:00.125
don't take tax advice from your family.

00:14:00.125 --> 00:14:00.833
Smart.

00:14:00.833 --> 00:14:01.333
Totally.

00:14:01.333 --> 00:14:02.208
But like, seriously, like how much money?

00:14:02.208 --> 00:14:04.208
The third rule of Fight-letico:

00:14:04.208 --> 00:14:07.875
To get a red card for violent conduct is easy.

00:14:07.875 --> 00:14:10.208
To get your opponent sent off for doing nothing—

00:14:10.208 --> 00:14:13.250
that is the work of a true assh--e.

00:14:13.250 --> 00:14:18.000
This is the real Madrid...Atletico style.

00:14:21.208 --> 00:14:23.208
I know I'm not an Atletico player,

00:14:23.208 --> 00:14:25.750
but they told me they had a safe space for violence.

00:14:25.750 --> 00:14:27.083
Uh, yes please.

00:14:30.958 --> 00:14:31.833
Whoa.

00:14:31.833 --> 00:14:34.958
Haha, I know. It's f--king intense.

00:14:37.583 --> 00:14:39.458
Uh...ouch.

00:14:41.708 --> 00:14:42.958
Finish him.

00:14:47.708 --> 00:14:49.375
I came back for this!

00:14:49.375 --> 00:14:52.250
Alright. I'm ready now.

00:14:52.583 --> 00:14:55.750
You gotta play to the whistle, Antoine.

00:15:00.583 --> 00:15:03.458
Look at that red-card virgin.

00:15:05.458 --> 00:15:07.333
Hey, what's going on, tough guys?

00:15:07.333 --> 00:15:08.708
Grabbing your cojones?

00:15:08.708 --> 00:15:11.333
This is you. This is what you look like.

00:15:11.333 --> 00:15:13.458
And this is what you look like.

00:15:13.458 --> 00:15:15.333
I knocked you out of the Champions League,

00:15:15.333 --> 00:15:17.333
and I can knock you out right here.

00:15:17.833 --> 00:15:19.583
OK, I didn't touch him.

00:15:19.583 --> 00:15:22.458
Stop shaking your heads disapprovingly. People love me.

00:15:22.458 --> 00:15:23.333
You all love me, right?

00:15:25.958 --> 00:15:27.125
Not cool, man.

00:15:27.125 --> 00:15:29.125
But without love I am just a shell.

00:15:29.125 --> 00:15:31.458
A really, really good-looking, talented shell!

00:15:35.583 --> 00:15:37.625
Wow. You are...shameless.

00:15:37.625 --> 00:15:39.958
I am legend.

00:15:39.958 --> 00:15:43.083
And legends need trophies!

00:15:43.083 --> 00:15:44.458
Okay, bye!

00:15:49.083 --> 00:15:49.958
Good fight, man.

00:15:49.958 --> 00:15:50.750
Good fight.

00:15:50.750 --> 00:15:51.583
(whispering)

00:15:51.583 --> 00:15:53.833
Wait. What did you say about mi madre?!

00:15:56.166 --> 00:15:59.333
What happens when 800 of the world’s most elite footballers

00:15:59.333 --> 00:16:02.208
and their managers compete in one musical variety show?

00:16:02.208 --> 00:16:05.666
Welcome to a very special episode of the Champions...

00:16:05.666 --> 00:16:08.666
UEFAVISION!

00:16:09.416 --> 00:16:11.791
I am your host, Sergio Ramos.

00:16:11.791 --> 00:16:13.833
Let's get started with our first act!

00:16:13.833 --> 00:16:17.791
Since Real won last year, I've been forced to host the UEFAvision.

00:16:17.791 --> 00:16:19.666
OK, so why you and not one of your teammates?

00:16:19.666 --> 00:16:21.541
You don't want me here? Pay me, I'll leave.

00:16:25.708 --> 00:16:26.541
We are Messi.

00:16:26.541 --> 00:16:27.833
We are Messi.

00:16:27.833 --> 00:16:29.208
It is our fate.

00:16:29.208 --> 00:16:30.666
It is our fate.

00:16:30.666 --> 00:16:35.458
When we're not blowing three-goal leads, we are great.

00:16:35.458 --> 00:16:37.958
Oh, we are Messi.

00:16:37.958 --> 00:16:40.791
It's time to show.

00:16:40.791 --> 00:16:45.541
That we are so much better than Cristiano.

00:16:45.541 --> 00:16:46.916
Sucks!

00:16:46.916 --> 00:16:49.458
LADIES AND GENTLEMEN, MY WIFE SHAKIRA.

00:16:49.458 --> 00:16:52.916
[yodeling]

00:16:54.166 --> 00:16:55.166
Fútbol.

00:16:57.166 --> 00:16:59.291
Game 1 we made Spurs look like a joke.

00:16:59.291 --> 00:17:01.333
But there's two games in a tie.

00:17:01.333 --> 00:17:03.666
And you'd best believe, the second we—

00:17:03.666 --> 00:17:04.666
CHOKED!

00:17:04.666 --> 00:17:07.541
Now it's transfer time. We goin' Dutch.

00:17:07.541 --> 00:17:11.041
So, how was Ajax? I skipped the second half.

00:17:11.041 --> 00:17:26.291
In Porto!

00:17:26.291 --> 00:17:29.291
Wow. Pepe. Uh, who would have guessed?

00:17:29.291 --> 00:17:31.583
So I was sort of hoping that since I'm leaving,

00:17:31.583 --> 00:17:33.791
I wouldn't have to join Dortmund on stage.

00:17:33.791 --> 00:17:37.541
Let's just say the German performances can get...pretty out there.

00:17:37.541 --> 00:17:40.083
You like our Yellow Wall?

00:17:40.083 --> 00:17:43.541
Now face our wall of noise...

00:17:43.541 --> 00:17:46.583
WALL OF NOISE!

00:17:46.583 --> 00:17:49.166
Man, I miss those guys.

00:17:49.166 --> 00:17:53.416
Schalke null vier. Schalke no fear.

00:17:55.166 --> 00:17:56.791
Wir sind die Knappen.

00:18:01.208 --> 00:18:11.208
Take me...take me back to the finals of the Champions League!

00:18:11.208 --> 00:18:14.416
Next up, Atletico, the poor man's Madrid.

00:18:15.708 --> 00:18:20.208
Singing for us will be my best friend, DRAKE!

00:18:20.791 --> 00:18:24.333
A girl up in my DMs, I think I'm gonna block her.

00:18:24.333 --> 00:18:27.666
I can't talk, honey. I'm out here watching soccer.

00:18:27.666 --> 00:18:30.916
They want to go to club, but I can't. God forbid.

00:18:30.916 --> 00:18:33.833
Cuz Lord knows I'm a big supporter of—

00:18:33.833 --> 00:18:35.458
Atletico Madrid.

00:18:35.541 --> 00:18:38.083
Wait. Atletico's out?! Who's in?

00:18:38.083 --> 00:18:39.333
Uh, Liverpool.

00:18:39.333 --> 00:18:40.916
So, yeah, growing up in Canada

00:18:40.916 --> 00:18:42.541
I've always been a huge fan of Liverpool.

00:18:46.291 --> 00:18:50.041
And that was PSG demonstrating why teamwork is important.

00:18:50.041 --> 00:18:53.583
And now for something completely different: too many English teams.

00:18:57.958 --> 00:19:00.041
That's the same crap they played last year.

00:19:00.041 --> 00:19:01.958
Why do they think they have a chance this time?

00:19:04.791 --> 00:19:06.916
Oh, he's good, yeah.

00:19:10.291 --> 00:19:11.708
Yeah!

00:19:13.541 --> 00:19:16.791
So Manchester's Blue.

00:19:18.791 --> 00:19:21.791
So glad we're not Man U.

00:19:23.916 --> 00:19:29.916
Funny how Alexis forgot how to score.

00:19:29.916 --> 00:19:33.083
They didn't make top four.

00:19:33.083 --> 00:19:36.458
Wait, so he can sing in English, but he only speaks Spanish?

00:19:36.458 --> 00:19:37.541
I don't get it.

00:19:38.166 --> 00:19:42.958
I might be just one man. But together, we're one man United!

00:19:42.958 --> 00:19:48.291
Uniiiiiited...now that Jose's gone.

00:19:51.791 --> 00:19:55.833
I came in like a cock-er-el.

00:19:55.833 --> 00:19:56.791
Ahhh!

00:19:57.666 --> 00:20:05.083
Oh. Ouch. Ooo. Um. OK, ladies and gentlemen, once again, Shakira!

00:20:05.083 --> 00:20:09.541
I can be a Champion.

